# Emulator: the paks are virtio disks and the initramfs has already mounted them at
# /mnt/tvservice, /mnt/otncabi, /mnt/otycabi, /mnt/fonts and /mnt/smartkey.
# /mnt/lg/ciplus/cert (mmcblk0p14) has no pak in the firmware and is left empty. (W15M's stock
# fstab: p14 and p27-p31.) The bind fstabs of this directory (fonts, smartkey, tvservice) are the
# stock ones.
